Subject: [M152] Harden AnimationBuilder against layer deletions during
 scheduling.

Original change's description:
> Harden AnimationBuilder against layer deletions during scheduling.
>
> For certain cases where a started animation is immediately finished when
> scheduled, the callbacks invoked might destroy the view on which the
> layer is animating. Any subsequence animation sequences for that layer
> are now invalid and can lead to a UAF as they're being scheduled. This
> tracks the lifetime of the layers while the AnimationBuilder instance
> is scheduling the animations.
>
